<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: SOCCER-LIECHTENSTEIN 0 MACEDONIA 4 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIECHTENSTEIN 0 MACEDONIA 4 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>ESCHEN, Liechtenstein 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macedonia led Liechtenstein 4-0 in their World Cup European group eight qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Dejvi Gavevski 8 and 13, Georgi Hristov 23, Mitko Stojkovski 38</p>
